{"seq":3,"slug":"fragmentation-and-memory-bloat","title":"内存膨胀与碎片治理：堆目标、scavenger 归还、GODEBUG 分配器开关与 RSS 偏差排查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/go-runtime-gc-scheduler-internals-gmp/memory-allocator-tcmcp/fragmentation-and-memory-bloat","wordCount":2473,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"内存膨胀与碎片治理-堆目标-scavenger-归还-godebug-分配器开关与-rss-偏差排查\">内存膨胀与碎片治理：堆目标、scavenger 归还、GODEBUG 分配器开关与 RSS 偏差排查</h1><p>线上最容易被误诊的一类问题不是「内存泄漏」，而是<strong>内存膨胀</strong>（memory bloat）：进程 RSS 一路爬到容器 limit 附近，<code>runtime.MemStats.Alloc</code> 却纹丝不动，pprof 里也找不到增长的对象。这类问题几乎总是三件事叠在一起——GC 的<strong>堆目标</strong>允许堆长到比存活对象大得多、scavenger <strong>归还物理页</strong>的速度赶不上分配速度、以及分配的<strong>取整与 span 碎片</strong>让记账值和实际占用对不上。本文按「先算目标、再看归还、再用开关取证、最后对账」的顺序拆开这条链路。分配器的分层结构（size class / span / mcache）已在同目录的 <a href=\"size-class-span-mcache-model\">层级分配模型</a> 中展开，这里直接从「堆长到多大」开始。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三层内存账本对不上才是常态\">核心概念：三层内存账本对不上才是常态</h2><p>Go 进程的内存有三套互不相等的账本，排查时必须先说清在看哪一本：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>账本</th>\n<th>观测入口</th>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>典型偏差原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Go 逻辑堆</td>\n<td><code>runtime.MemStats.Alloc</code> / <code>/memory/classes/heap/objects:bytes</code></td>\n<td>存活对象的字节数</td>\n<td>不含 span 剩余空间、不含元数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时管理内存</td>\n<td><code>/memory/classes/total:bytes</code>、<code>GOMEMLIMIT</code> 的记账口径</td>\n<td>堆对象 + 空闲 span + GC 元数据 + 栈</td>\n<td>含 <code>heap/free</code>、<code>heap/unused</code>、<code>metadata</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进程 / 容器物理内存</td>\n<td><code>/proc/self/status</code> 的 <code>VmRSS</code>、cgroup v2 的 <code>memory.current</code></td>\n<td>已触达的物理页（含 Go 之外的部分）</td>\n<td>页缓存、cgo、mmap、共享库、未归还的 span</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键点：<strong><code>GOMEMLIMIT</code> 管的是第二本账，不是第三本</strong>。Go 官方 GC 指南（<code>go.dev/doc/gc-guide</code>，Go 1.19 起）明确说明内存上限覆盖 runtime 管理的内存，不覆盖 cgo 分配、不覆盖 OS 侧开销（页表等）。所以把 <code>GOMEMLIMIT</code> 设成容器 limit 的 100% 是常见误用——rest 部分要留给非 Go 内存。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;用户分配 mallocgc&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;堆对象 objects:bytes&lt;br/&gt;存活可达&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;对象释放后 span 未整块空闲&quot;| C[&quot;heap/free:bytes&lt;br/&gt;span 内已释放槽位&lt;br/&gt;无法归还 OS&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;span 整块空闲但仍被 mcache 持有&quot;| D[&quot;heap/unused:bytes&lt;br/&gt;空闲 span + mcache 库存&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;mheap 归还物理页&quot;| E[&quot;heap/released:bytes&lt;br/&gt;已 madvise 但地址空间还留着&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;scavenger 慢于分配&quot;| F[&quot;RSS 高位不降&lt;br/&gt;进程被 OOMKilled&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; G[&quot;metadata:bytes&lt;br/&gt;span/arena/GC 位图&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;再次分配命中空闲地址&quot;| D\">graph TD\n    A[\"用户分配 mallocgc\"] --&gt; B[\"堆对象 objects:bytes&lt;br/&gt;存活可达\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"对象释放后 span 未整块空闲\"| C[\"heap/free:bytes&lt;br/&gt;span 内已释放槽位&lt;br/&gt;无法归还 OS\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"span 整块空闲但仍被 mcache 持有\"| D[\"heap/unused:bytes&lt;br/&gt;空闲 span + mcache 库存\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"mheap 归还物理页\"| E[\"heap/released:bytes&lt;br/&gt;已 madvise 但地址空间还留着\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"scavenger 慢于分配\"| F[\"RSS 高位不降&lt;br/&gt;进程被 OOMKilled\"]\n    B --&gt; G[\"metadata:bytes&lt;br/&gt;span/arena/GC 位图\"]\n    E --&gt;|\"再次分配命中空闲地址\"| D</pre><p><code>heap/free</code> 与 <code>heap/unused</code> 是两个必须区分的碎片口径：前者是 <em>span 内部</em> 的空槽（跨 size class 无法复用，只能等这个 span 的对象全部死掉），后者是 <em>span 级别</em> 的空闲（可以由 mheap 借给其它 size class 或归还）。线上「堆里全是碎片」的判断，看的是这两个量之和相对 <code>objects</code> 的比例，而不是 <code>HeapIdle</code> 这个老字段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"堆目标公式-gogc-与-gomemlimit-如何各让一半\">堆目标公式：GOGC 与 GOMEMLIMIT 如何各让一半</h2><p>GC pacer 每轮标记结束都要重算下一次触发的堆目标。Go 运行时 <code>src/runtime/mgc.go</code> 的 <code>computeHeapGoal</code> 用的形式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{goal} = H_{live} + (H_{live} + R) \\times \\frac{GOGC}{100}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">GO</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">GC</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{live}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是标记结束时的存活堆（<code>/gc/heap/live:bytes</code>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是 GC 根（栈、全局变量等）带来的额外扫描量。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">GOGC=100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">GO</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">GC</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>（默认）意味着「堆允许长到存活量的两倍再加根的开销」。这个放大系数正是膨胀的第一来源：存活 200MB 的服务，默认配置下 RSS 摸到 400MB 以上是完全正常的行为，不是泄漏。</p>\n<p><code>GOMEMLIMIT</code>（Go 1.19 引入，源自提案 golang/go#48409）不改变这个公式，而是在它之上加一道<strong>上限</strong>：如果按 GOGC 算出的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{goal}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 超过了内存上限推导出的目标，就取更小的那个；反之如果 GC 太频繁（堆目标低于存活量），内存上限会<strong>放宽</strong> GOGC，让 GC 少跑几轮换取吞吐。因此二者是「下限保吞吐、上限保安全」的互补关系，不是互相覆盖。</p>\n<p>工程上常把两者一起设，做法是显式给一个 20%–30% 的余量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 容器 limit 1GiB，给 Go runtime 800MiB 软上限，留 200MiB 给 cgo/页表/页缓存&#10;GOMEMLIMIT=800MiB GOGC=100 ./orders-api\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 容器 limit 1GiB，给 Go runtime 800MiB 软上限，留 200MiB 给 cgo/页表/页缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">GOMEMLIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">800MiB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GOGC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ./orders-api</span></span></code></pre></div><p>反过来的陷阱是「GOMEMLIMIT 调到极限 + GOGC=off」：这会让 GC 只在触及上限时才跑，一旦存活量接近上限，pacer 会退化成持续 GC（GC 死亡螺旋），<code>/gc/cycles/total:gc-cycles</code> 速率暴涨而 CPU 打满。安全做法是保留一个<strong>非负的 GOGC</strong>作为地板，让 pacer 在内存压力下仍能提前介入。</p>\n<p><code>/gc/gogc:percent</code> 与 <code>/gc/gomemlimit:bytes</code> 两个 runtime/metrics 指标可以运行时读出当前生效值，是核对配置是否真的注入成功的第一手证据（环境变量被 systemd/容器编排吃掉的情况并不罕见）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"scavenger-物理页归还为什么总是慢半拍\">scavenger：物理页归还为什么总是慢半拍</h2><p>堆目标只管「GC 什么时候跑」，不保证「内存还给操作系统」。归还是 <code>runtime</code> 后台 <strong>scavenger</strong> 的职责：它扫描 mheap 的空闲 span，对整块空闲的物理页调用 <code>madvise</code>。Linux 上这条路径的历史值得记住——Go 1.12–1.15 默认使用 <code>MADV_FREE</code>（页标记为可回收但 RSS 不立即下降），可用 <code>GODEBUG=madvdontneed=1</code> 强制换成 <code>MADV_DONTNEED</code>（立即扣减 RSS）；<strong>Go 1.16 起默认改回 <code>MADV_DONTNEED</code></strong>（见 Go 1.16 release notes &quot;Runtime&quot; 一节），此后 RSS 曲线才与归还行为基本同步。</p>\n<p>scavenger 是一个状态机（<code>src/runtime/mheap.go</code>），四个状态刻在 <code>scavtrace</code> 输出里：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>何时出现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>scavenge</code></td>\n<td>正在按速率上限归还页</td>\n<td>后台常态，由 sysmon 启动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>scavengeWait</code></td>\n<td>达到本轮目标后睡眠等待</td>\n<td>系统内存充足时占绝大多数时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>scavengenoff</code></td>\n<td>被显式关闭</td>\n<td>GC 标记阶段 <code>debug.gcscavenger</code> 暂停</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>scavengeDecayed</code></td>\n<td>按指数衰减估算可用页</td>\n<td>分配突发前的保守估计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>打开 <code>GODEBUG=scavtrace=1</code> 会按秒打印一行，字段含义是：<code>scav N K=...</code> 表示本轮归还 N 页、<code>slow=...</code> 是主动归还耗时、<code>bg=...</code> 是后台归还量。一个健康的服务里 <code>bg</code> 应占绝大多数；如果 <code>slow</code> 持续非零，说明分配速率已经超过后台 scavenger 的速率上限，分配路径正在<strong>内联</strong>做内存回收（<code>mheap.grow</code> 时同步 scavenge），这是延迟毛刺的直接来源。</p>\n<p>后台速率有一个刻意的上限：scavenger 保证归还速度不超过「每 1ms 归还 1 页 × CPU 数」量级的目标，并与 GC 的 CPU 预算（25%，见 <code>gcController</code> 的 <code>gcBGMarkWorker</code> 份额）共享调度机会。这意味着<strong>内存快速增长的服务天然追不上归还速度</strong>，RSS 会短暂冲高——这是设计，不是 bug。要快速回落需要主动触发：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"import &quot;runtime/debug&quot;&#10;&#10;func shedMemory() {&#10;    debug.FreeOSMemory() // 触发一次 GC + 同步 scavenge，代价是 STW 抖动&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">runtime/debug</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shedMemory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    debug.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FreeOSMemory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 触发一次 GC + 同步 scavenge，代价是 STW 抖动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>debug.FreeOSMemory()</code> 在 Go 1.16 后的实现已经改为「先 GC 再全量 scavenge」，适合在明确的低峰窗口（如批处理结束）调用，不适合放进请求路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"godebug-分配器与-gc-开关速查\">GODEBUG 分配器与 GC 开关速查</h2><p>排查膨胀时真正用得上的 <code>GODEBUG</code> 开关并不多，下表按「看现象 → 看数据 → 看代码」三档整理（开关与文件路径均可在 <code>src/runtime/</code> 与 <code>doc/godebug.md</code> 中核对）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>开关</th>\n<th>输出/作用</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>gctrace=1</code></td>\n<td>每轮 GC 一行：堆大小/目标/暂停</td>\n<td>判断 GC 是否在按堆目标正常触发</td>\n<td>首行含 <code>gc N @t s X%: ...</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>gcpacertrace=1</code></td>\n<td>pacer 内部状态：目标、扫描速率、信用</td>\n<td>GC 频率异常升高时定位 pacer</td>\n<td>与 <code>gctrace</code> 联用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>scavtrace=1</code></td>\n<td>每秒归还页数、<code>slow</code>/<code>bg</code> 拆分</td>\n<td>RSS 不降或 <code>slow</code> 非零</td>\n<td>见上一节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>schedtrace=N</code></td>\n<td>每 N ms 打印 P/M/G 与 runqueue</td>\n<td>排除「其实是调度停顿」的假内存问题</td>\n<td>开销大，短时使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>inittrace=1</code></td>\n<td>各包 <code>init()</code> 耗时与内存</td>\n<td>启动阶段 RSS 冲高</td>\n<td>Go 1.16+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>allocfreetrace=1</code></td>\n<td>记录每次分配的栈（含释放）</td>\n<td>定位泄漏而非膨胀</td>\n<td>极慢，仅本地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>madvdontneed=1</code></td>\n<td>强制 <code>MADV_DONTNEED</code></td>\n<td>Go 1.16 前的老版本兼容</td>\n<td>1.16+ 已是默认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个易错点：其一，<code>gctrace=1</code> 的堆目标列是<strong>目标值</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{goal}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），拿它去和 RSS 对比偏差会大到无法解释；其二，<code>GODEBUG</code> 的值在进程启动时解析一次并缓存，<strong>修改后必须重启</strong>，运行时改环境变量无效。运行时读取用 <code>runtime/metrics</code> 更可靠——无需重启、无需解析日志，且带明确单位后缀：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"import &quot;runtime/metrics&quot;&#10;&#10;func snapshot() {&#10;    names := []string{&#10;        &quot;/gc/heap/goal:bytes&quot;,            // 下一次 GC 的目标&#10;        &quot;/gc/heap/live:bytes&quot;,            // 上轮标记后的存活&#10;        &quot;/memory/classes/heap/free:bytes&quot;,   // span 内碎片&#10;        &quot;/memory/classes/heap/unused:bytes&quot;, // 空闲 span&#10;        &quot;/memory/classes/heap/released:bytes&quot;,&#10;        &quot;/memory/classes/total:bytes&quot;,    // GOMEMLIMIT 记账口径&#10;    }&#10;    samples := make([]metrics.Sample, len(names))&#10;    for i, n := range names {&#10;        samples[i].Name = n&#10;    }&#10;    metrics.Read(samples)&#10;    // 采样值写入监控：goal/live 比值即当前放大系数&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">runtime/metrics</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> snapshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    names </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"/gc/heap/goal:bytes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 下一次 GC 的目标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"/gc/heap/live:bytes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 上轮标记后的存活</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"/memory/classes/heap/free:bytes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// span 内碎片</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"/memory/classes/heap/unused:bytes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 空闲 span</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"/memory/classes/heap/released:bytes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"/memory/classes/total:bytes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// GOMEMLIMIT 记账口径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    samples </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Sample</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(names))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> names {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        samples[i].Name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    metrics.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Read</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(samples)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 采样值写入监控：goal/live 比值即当前放大系数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"rss-偏差排查-把三本账摆到同一张表上\">RSS 偏差排查：把三本账摆到同一张表上</h2><p>有了上面的口径，排查就变成一次机械的对账。推荐顺序固定为四步，每步都要拿到可核对数字而不是印象：</p>\n<p><strong>第一步，先分 cgroup 与进程。</strong> 读 cgroup v2 的 <code>memory.current</code> 与 <code>memory.stat</code>：如果 <code>file</code> 项（页缓存）占了大部分而 <code>anon</code> 不高，膨胀来自文件 IO 而非 Go 堆，调 <code>GOMEMLIMIT</code> 无用。cgroup v1 对应 <code>memory.usage_in_bytes</code>。容器里 <code>VmRSS</code> 与 <code>memory.current</code> 常常差出一大截，正是页缓存造成的。</p>\n<p><strong>第二步，把 Go 侧四类内存加总。</strong> <code>objects + free + unused + released + metadata + stacks</code> 应接近 <code>/memory/classes/total:bytes</code>；若 <code>total</code> 明显小于 <code>memory.current - file</code>，差值就是 cgo 或非 Go 的 mmap（典型如 DNS 解析、SQLite、TLS 之外的第三方库）。</p>\n<p><strong>第三步，看碎片比例而不是绝对值。</strong> 定义碎片率</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>heap/free</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>heap/unused</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>heap/objects</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>heap/free</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>heap/unused</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = \\frac{\\text{heap/free} + \\text{heap/unused}}{\\text{heap/objects} + \\text{heap/free} + \\text{heap/unused}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">heap/objects</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">heap/free</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">heap/unused</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">heap/free</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">heap/unused</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 长期高于约 0.3 且 RSS 触顶时，问题在分配模式而非目标配置：常见成因是<strong>混合 size class 的生命周期</strong>——短命的小对象与长命的大对象落在相邻 class，长命对象钉住 span，短命对象腾出的槽位无法归还；或者大量 <code>[]byte</code> 容量远大于长度的切片，实际占用按 cap 而不是 len 走 size class。</p>\n<p><strong>第四步，用 pprof 区分「泄漏」与「膨胀」。</strong> <code>-inuse_space</code> 高说明存活对象真多（泄漏或缓存无上限）；若 <code>-inuse_space</code> 低而 RSS 高，就是本文讨论的膨胀，此时 <code>-alloc_space</code> 只反映分配速率，不能作为泄漏证据。排查短命对象热点用 <code>-alloc_objects</code> 更有信息量。</p>\n<p>一个必须记住的副作用：归还给 OS 的地址空间仍被 runtime 保留（<code>heap/released</code>），<strong>再次分配时会优先复用这些页</strong>，所以 RSS 经常「降下来又涨回去」。这会在压测对比中制造「优化无效」的错觉——正确做法是重启进程后再压。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三本账（逻辑堆 / runtime 管理内存 / RSS）口径不同，膨胀的本质是三者差值；<code>GOMEMLIMIT</code> 只管中间那本。</li>\n<li>堆目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>G</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>G</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{goal} = H_{live} + (H_{live}+R)\\cdot GOGC/100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">GO</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">GC</span><span class=\"mord\">/100</span></span></span></span></span> 是膨胀的第一来源，默认 GOGC=100 允许存活量翻倍；<code>GOMEMLIMIT</code> 只设上限、不替换公式。</li>\n<li>归还是 scavenger 的职责，<code>MADV_DONTNEED</code> 自 Go 1.16 起成为 Linux 默认；后台速率有上限，快速增长的堆天然追不上。</li>\n<li><code>GODEBUG</code> 开关启动时一次性解析；运行时取证优先用 <code>runtime/metrics</code>，指标名带单位后缀可自校验。</li>\n<li>排查固定四步：cgroup 分 file/anon → Go 侧四类加总 → 碎片率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> → pprof 区分 <code>-inuse_space</code>（泄漏）与 RSS（膨胀）。</li>\n<li>减少碎片最有效的动作往往是改分配模式（控制切片 cap、收敛对象尺寸档位），而不是继续调 GC 参数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内存膨胀与碎片治理：堆目标、scavenger 归还、GODEBUG 分配器开关与 RSS 偏差排查","id":"内存膨胀与碎片治理-堆目标-scavenger-归还-godebug-分配器开关与-rss-偏差排查"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三层内存账本对不上才是常态","id":"核心概念-三层内存账本对不上才是常态"},{"level":2,"text":"堆目标公式：GOGC 与 GOMEMLIMIT 如何各让一半","id":"堆目标公式-gogc-与-gomemlimit-如何各让一半"},{"level":2,"text":"scavenger：物理页归还为什么总是慢半拍","id":"scavenger-物理页归还为什么总是慢半拍"},{"level":2,"text":"GODEBUG 分配器与 GC 开关速查","id":"godebug-分配器与-gc-开关速查"},{"level":2,"text":"RSS 偏差排查：把三本账摆到同一张表上","id":"rss-偏差排查-把三本账摆到同一张表上"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分配路径与逃逸分析：tiny/small/large 三档、栈上分配到堆提升与对象大小对齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/go-runtime-gc-scheduler-internals-gmp/memory-allocator-tcmcp/allocation-path-escape-analysis"},"next":{"title":"三色不变式与屏障类型：Dijkstra 插入写屏障、Yuasa 删除屏障与混合写屏障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/go-runtime-gc-scheduler-internals-gmp/tricolor-gc-write-barrier/tricolor-invariant-and-barriers"}}